  first | exact @GlobalTheory.ModelAbLocus.abLocus_eq_and_pol | exact GlobalTheory.ModelAbLocus.abLocus_eq_and_pol | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.ModelAbLocus.abLocus_eq_and_pol <;> assumption)
